        "source": "def investigate(context, acquire):\n    values = context[\"values\"]\n    n = len(values)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    # contribution list: p(x) + g*x*prev, with p(x)=a*x+b*x*x+c*x*x*x\n    # inferred: a=0, b=0, c=1 -> p(x)=x*x*x; g=1 with preceding value\n    contrib = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        x = values[i]\n        p = x*x*x\n        if i > 0:\n            p = p + x * values[i-1]\n        contrib.append(p)\n    # apply cumulative-sum passes; inferred count = 3\n    for _ in range(3):\n        acc = 0\n        new = []\n        for v in contrib:\n            acc = acc + v\n            new.append(acc)\n        contrib = new\n    return contrib[-1]\n",
        "scope": "Synthetic integer sequence readout: contribution per position is p(x)=x*x*x plus g*x times the immediately preceding value (g=1), then three cumulative-sum passes; return the final entry. Empty input returns 0.",
